<title>USA: Cytel says names Deborah Schueren CFO.</title>
<headline>Cytel says names Deborah Schueren CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cytel Corp said it had named Deborah Schueren as chief financial officer, effective mid-April.</p>
<p>Schueren will succeed Karin Eastham, who is leaving the company to become CFO of a private San Diego-based biotechnology company, Cytel said.</p>
<p>Schueren has been with Cytel -- itself a San Diego-based biotechnology company -- since 1992. Her most recent position was director of business development.</p>
